<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>Examples 5-8: Maximum Amount of the Daily Financing Rate</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>Example 5: The Index level alternatively increases then decreases
