    <TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; width: 20%; text-align: center"><B>% Change of <BR>
Closing Indicative <BR>
Note Value from <BR>
Day 0</B></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
